WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:08.000
The experience. A visitor explores the RaizHost website and its examples. The film shows the public site, captured in September 2026.

00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:16.000
The edit. The owner editor changes a bounded content file while the site’s design stays in code. This portion illustrates the documented editing contract.

00:00:16.000 --> 00:00:24.000
The delivery. Publishing creates a commit in the client’s repository. Its workflow builds the site, updates S3, and invalidates CloudFront. The public architecture record explains the boundaries.
